      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10856430::web::012::3_3_observation_of_the_microstructure",
        "PMC10856430::web::013::4_discussions",
        "PMC10856430::web::014::4_discussions"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed comparison uses AlCoCrFeNiTi0.5 variants with systematically graded Al content and otherwise similar compositions.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The alloy variants will be oxidized in air at approximately 1000 °C for 100 hours under identical conditions.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The relevant structural mediator is the development and continuity of an Al2O3-rich surface scale.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10856430::web::012::3_3_observation_of_the_microstructure",
        "PMC10856430::web::013::4_discussions",
        "PMC10856430::web::014::4_discussions"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Al has high diffusivity during high-temperature exposure.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10856430::web::012::3_3_observation_of_the_microstructure",
        "PMC10856430::web::014::4_discussions"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Al has a strong oxygen affinity under the proposed oxidation conditions.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10856430::web::014::4_discussions"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Al2O3 formation is thermodynamically favored by its highly negative Gibbs free energy and low required oxygen partial pressure relative to oxides of Cr, Fe, Co, and Ni.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10856430::web::014::4_discussions"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Al diffuses toward the surface and oxidizes preferentially to form Al2O3.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10856430::web::012::3_3_observation_of_the_microstructure",
        "PMC10856430::web::014::4_discussions"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "A dense, continuous Al2O3 layer limits further oxygen ingress.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10856430::web::014::4_discussions"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "A dense, continuous Al2O3 layer limits further elemental diffusion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10856430::web::014::4_discussions"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Controlled changes in bulk Al content directly modulate Al segregation and oxidation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Higher-Al variants will have a significantly lower oxidation rate than lower-Al variants, as measured by weight gain and oxygen ingress.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Higher-Al variants will form a more coherent and continuous predominantly Al2O3 scale than lower-Al variants.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The protective scale will be dense.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10856430::web::012::3_3_observation_of_the_microstructure",
